    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121610/extras/93015275ef8c34430a05081481d6c3d5.avif?t=1723246177\" width=404 height=127 /></span><br>This short story is about Syrius, an adventurer who had to pay a steep price for insulting the Great Witch on his wedding day with his beloved Arlene. <br><br>He is sent back in time to relive his first &quot;adventure,&quot; a tedious affair that displeases the Great Witch. Soon, she'll turn this boring story into one to her liking. <br><br>Syrius will relive this story, seeing Arlene become a whole new person. Will this turn him against her? Or will his love endure the Witch's intentions? <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121610/extras/b370879d706a5a43c482af330b282670.avif?t=1723246177\" width=404 height=127 /></span><br>The story is a kinetic novel that allows you to move freely around the town. As a player, you can complete the assigned tasks without any impediment, but you can also look around and see what Arlene is up to.<br><br>As the story becomes more corrupted, you can visit her multiple times and see how things progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121610/extras/76ae671feb0edf86dc53b59ddfee9530.avif?t=1723246177\" width=404 height=127 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A NTR story (Not avoidable!)<br></li><li>Over 50 scenes! <br></li><li>Transparent or solid obstacles</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121610/extras/93015275ef8c34430a05081481d6c3d5.avif?t=1723246177\" width=404 height=127 /></span><br>This short story is about Syrius, an adventurer who had to pay a steep price for insulting the Great Witch on his wedding day with his beloved Arlene. <br><br>He is sent back in time to relive his first &quot;adventure,&quot; a tedious affair that displeases the Great Witch. Soon, she'll turn this boring story into one to her liking. <br><br>Syrius will relive this story, seeing Arlene become a whole new person. Will this turn him against her? Or will his love endure the Witch's intentions? <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121610/extras/b370879d706a5a43c482af330b282670.avif?t=1723246177\" width=404 height=127 /></span><br>The story is a kinetic novel that allows you to move freely around the town. As a player, you can complete the assigned tasks without any impediment, but you can also look around and see what Arlene is up to.<br><br>As the story becomes more corrupted, you can visit her multiple times and see how things progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121610/extras/76ae671feb0edf86dc53b59ddfee9530.avif?t=1723246177\" width=404 height=127 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A NTR story (Not avoidable!)<br></li><li>Over 50 scenes! <br></li><li>Transparent or solid obstacles</li></ul>",
